  "html": "<article data-article-id=\"d2b6492b-231a-4720-ae3d-edfca333e044\">\n  <p>Many, many thanks to all who responded so generously to the need we made known in our last issue. In the July/August Remnant, we made known our need of Tape Ministry funds and since then we have received a tremendous response. Enough donations have been received to move us from $40,000 below to currently $20,000 above! We are awed, and thank God and all of you who unselfishly and generously gave of that which God has blessed you with.</p>\n</article>\n",
